:false},"body":"Adds an explicit local Fleet receiver for bounded six-stage Discovery Lab requests, with installed mission/source/runtime/commission expectations and fresh semantic inspection. Receipts retain authority:none, zero-cap draft commissions and unprovisioned external execution. The transport fixture establishes schema compatibility only.\n\nThe common parser now encodes the descriptor values it captured, including a safe captured array length, and resource/binding/request validators check one inert snapshot before digest suspension. Width, depth, node and encoded-byte guards remain. Fleet's own callback already captures one inert report immediately after awaiting it; its receiver and qualification runtime code are unchanged.\n\n| Current source | Identity |\n| --- | --- |\n| Fleet head | `0dd352fdd2b1af00bc8358e0ac7f96682fd6f796` |\n| Fleet tree | `79415af24ebf57d30981f841f13b7969e4193502` |\n| Alpha commit | `0385df4c9728db19c396e039cd04678eebfddb9e` |\n| Alpha sourceHash | `46858f3b1e5e2b5cc00f0118b0ec3660d8d701cfa726e097475757efd141442a` |\n| Shared contract SHA256 | `98c8de8ce2774b7650bf4ee11eeedfb0a69b75fa6d1b080ef823637d77d0ab47` |\n\nAll29 pinned Alpha blobs/modes match the public source. All18 changed Fleet entries and the full tree match the reviewed frozen candidate; fetched public raw blobs match every SHA256/size and working file. The connector commit is unsigned. [Source pin](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Fleet-Linux/blob/0dd352fdd2b1af00bc8358e0ac7f96682fd6f796/discovery-lab/alpha-source-pin.json), [reproduction guide](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Fleet-Linux/blob/0dd352fdd2b1af00bc8358e0ac7f96682fd6f796/discovery-lab/README.md) and [three unchanged original browser inputs](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Fleet-Linux/tree/0dd352fdd2b1af00bc8358e0ac7f96682fd6f796/discovery-lab/evidence/browser-0385-inputs) are public.\n\nLocal evidence:\n- Each pinned Node24.21.0 and22.17.1:45/45 actual native cases,44/44 boundary regressions and both actual raw browser routes pass.\n- The seven new snapshot cases fail against saved public c0/common9d2; all current cases pass. Fleet callback regressions verify false cannot become accepted and negative counters cannot become credits.\n- 179 engineering tests, source/preservation and five output-directory tests pass.\n- Separate same-session review verifies all18 changed entries,29 pins and62 preserved old evidence files. It independently passes39 pure tests and45 native cases on both profiles, recomputes every reservation and accepted encoded/checking term, and confirms1,055 ordinary canonical encodings unchanged.\n- The conservative pre-check memory reservation retains the1MB floor, four explicit canonical footprints and500,000 working reserve. Native checking remains4096 receiver units plus the authenticated10,000 inspection charge and ancestor charter caps. No VM-heap measurement or hard-preemption claim is made.\n- Six trailing-space lines occur only in the verbatim saved failing TAP and are retained as original evidence; diff--check reports them. No raw run is rewritten.\n\nThe actual browser workspace SHA256 is fb255c1bf33db82b240c452bcdd1334260d7934d5d2eed984f261109f34bd340. Its complete12-check packaged-local browser dataset is separately public at [Alpha598338fd](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Alpha-Agent-v0/tree/598338fdc2542087877981f750a23359501d9e08/evidence/discovery-lab-0385). The bundled Fleet inputs/receipts independently reconstruct the current stronger campaign and verified parent allowances; null installed context stays unprovisioned.\n\nFresh current source/repository/Pages/release workflow runs are queued. Actual current hosted source archive extraction/execution is pending; old c310/Alpha1665 and c0/daa8 proofs retain their own scope. A newly configured Alpha review found a separate direct validateArtifact mutation/return boundary at0385; its narrow artifact snapshot correction is in progress upstream. These positive literal-JSON observations do not establish that boundary, and final pin/release qualification remains held for its corrected source.\n\nThis source-only module is included in the existing full Git review archive. Operator installers and local-runtime/package.py omit it. Existing ordinary checks apply; no operator release, installed Fleet service, protected holdout, organizational independence or eligible-owner approval is claimed. Held#61 is unchanged. Future operator packaging requires its own declared profile/inventory and applicable boundary review.\n\nTracks#63 and [Alpha#4850](https://github.com/MontrealAI/AGI-Alpha-Agent-v0/issues/4850).","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T19:30:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:42:47Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"bef7dd125958b2e336743217f1d9d00451efd17c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MontrealAI:feat/discovery-lab-receiver-20261021","ref":"feat/discovery-lab-receiver-20261021","repo":{"id":1412491845,"node_id":"R_kgDOVDDqRQ","name":"AGI-Fleet-Linux","full_name":"MontrealAI/AGI-Fleet-Linux","owner":{"login":"MontrealAI","id":24208299,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjA4Mjk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24208299?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI","html_url":"https://github.com/MontrealAI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MontrealAI/events{/privacy}","received_ev